  "body": "To make it clear which (new) APIs are available on insecure contexts and encourage spec authors to make a conscious decision, I propose adding `[InsecureContext]` as a peer to `[SecureContext]`.\r\n\r\nSuch an attribute would also enable tools, such as Bikeshed and IDL compilers, to ensure that one or the other has been specified.",
